    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d580">

                <pb facs="0584" n="418" sameAs="frus:frus1917/pg418"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 337.11/260</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Minister Gonzales to
                        the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegrams]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Habana</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-03-12T11:00:00-05:29">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">March 12, 1917, 11 a.m</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Last midnight succeeded in getting body fifty regulars to start from Nuevitas to
                    La Gloria for the protection of isolated and apprehensive American colony.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Gonzales</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
